    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story\u00a0that turns everyday tasks into journeys.\u00a0<i>Can you be the voice that doesn\u2019t let her down?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intrusive Thoughts</strong> is a visual novel shown through\u00a0an intense internal world. Simple actions like stepping outside or buying groceries become epic challenges for the protagonist, who is caught between biting humor and dark self-reflection. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each choice you make could lead to moments of surprising clarity or spiraling despair, as the main character's relentless inner voice shapes the way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a story, it's an experience in mental and emotional landscapes.\u00a0By being the first to understand her, maybe you\u2019ll help her find a way through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelated graphic style</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short duration (20-30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark immersive story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story\u00a0that turns everyday tasks into journeys.\u00a0<i>Can you be the voice that doesn\u2019t let her down?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intrusive Thoughts</strong> is a visual novel shown through\u00a0an intense internal world. Simple actions like stepping outside or buying groceries become epic challenges for the protagonist, who is caught between biting humor and dark self-reflection. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each choice you make could lead to moments of surprising clarity or spiraling despair, as the main character's relentless inner voice shapes the way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a story, it's an experience in mental and emotional landscapes.\u00a0By being the first to understand her, maybe you\u2019ll help her find a way through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelated graphic style</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short duration (20-30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark immersive story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
